// GroupBoostedConstrainedStep returns eosToken or a parser-valid next token, and
// AppendConstrainedToken preserves parser validity. In the plain constrained
// branch, ConstrainedStep preserves parser validity internally. In the recovery
// branch, RollbackToBoundary returns a parser-valid repaired prefix, and after
// trimming generated to match that repaired prefix we remain inside with a valid
// currentConstrainedOut.
//
